{"nodes": [{"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_document", "label": "BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_1", "label": "Issue #1 \u2014 Decidir SGBD (PostgreSQL vs H2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RNF02 exige PostgreSQL, mas o produto \u00e9 offline/monousu\u00e1rio na m\u00e1quina do gestor; um servidor PostgreSQL traz instalador, servi\u00e7o, porta e senha de superusu\u00e1rio \u2014 maior risco de o sistema n\u00e3o subir na entrega. H2 embarcado (depend\u00eancia Maven, arquivo \u00fanico) \u00e9 a alternativa caso n\u00e3o haja exig\u00eancia r\u00edgida de nota. Em qualquer cen\u00e1rio o acesso a dados deve ficar atr\u00e1s de interfaces de reposit\u00f3rio."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_3", "label": "Issue #3 \u2014 Implementar Schema do Banco de Dados", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Planejava migra\u00e7\u00e3o via Flyway (V1__schema.sql), abordagem depois descartada (ver issue #7): a inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o passou a ser feita por BancoInicializador executando schema.sql/seed.sql direto do classpath."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_5", "label": "Issue #5 \u2014 Padronizar Fluxo de Git e Guia de Contribui\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_6", "label": "Issue #6 \u2014 Configurar Build e Testes no GitHub Actions", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_7", "label": "Issue #7 \u2014 Conex\u00e3o H2 e Inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o Autom\u00e1tica do Banco", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica, nenhuma issue de reposit\u00f3rio consegue ser testada (H2 cria arquivo vazio, consultas falham). Flyway foi descartado em favor de BancoInicializador, que executa schema.sql e seed.sql idempotentes na partida; o seed permite outras frentes desenvolverem sem depender da tela de cadastro."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_8", "label": "Issue #8 \u2014 Criar Classes de Dom\u00ednio", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_25", "label": "Issue #25 \u2014 Valida\u00e7\u00e3o do Intervalo de Descanso (RF11)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_26", "label": "Issue #26 \u2014 M\u00ednimo de Agentes e Bloqueio de Duplicidade (RF05, RF10)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_58", "label": "Issue #58 \u2014 Decidir Algoritmo de Hash de Senha (BCrypt vs Argon2id)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OWASP A04:2025 recomenda Argon2id/scrypt/PBKDF2 e trata BCrypt como legado. O jbcrypt (org.mindrot) j\u00e1 est\u00e1 no pom.xml e est\u00e1 sem manuten\u00e7\u00e3o desde 2010; como ainda n\u00e3o h\u00e1 senha gravada, a troca custa uma classe agora e fica cara depois."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_59", "label": "Issue #59 \u2014 Proteger o Arquivo do Banco de Dados", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Maior risco do sistema (CWE-922, CWE-732): login e perfis podem ser contornados por quem copiar o arquivo do banco. Requer senha de acesso n\u00e3o vazia/n\u00e3o fixa e diret\u00f3rio com permiss\u00e3o restrita; risco residual reconhecido \u00e9 a depend\u00eancia de criptografia de disco do SO (ex.: BitLocker) num desktop monousu\u00e1rio."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_65", "label": "Issue #65 \u2014 Verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de Depend\u00eancias Vulner\u00e1veis no CI", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OWASP A03 foi a categoria mais votada como risco n\u00ba1; pom.xml puxa JavaFX, H2, Flyway, PDFBox e BCrypt mais depend\u00eancias transitivas \u2014 precedente citado \u00e9 o Log4Shell."}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_66", "label": "Issue #66 \u2014 Endurecer Configura\u00e7\u00e3o da Aplica\u00e7\u00e3o e do H2", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_70", "label": "Issue #70 \u2014 Tela de Configura\u00e7\u00f5es da Organiza\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_71", "label": "Issue #71 \u2014 Reposit\u00f3rios de TipoTurno, MotivoCobertura e Configuracao", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_25", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rf11", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_26", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rf05", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_26", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rf10", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_26", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rnf06", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_26", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rnf08", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_1", "target": "legado_readme_original_delegacia_rnf02", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/BACKLOG_ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_backlog_issues_issue_1", "target": "dao_conexaobanco_conexaobanco", "relation": "rati